   author.

   .. code-block:: python

      vset.AddVariant('red')
      vset.AddVariant('blue')
      vset.AddVariant('green')
      print(stage.GetRootLayer().ExportToString())

   produces

   .. code-block:: usd
      :emphasize-lines: 20-29

